            "author": {
                "name": "MarcusCaspeco",
                "url": "https://github.com/MarcusCaspeco"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26078826?u=9388a2c2a0f1ca2799a4fd23f3e060c353d6ac37&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fix typo in <code class=\"notranslate\">Element#checkVisibility</code> example <code class=\"notranslate\">display: content</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">display: contents</code>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The live example currently doesn't properly demonstrate the intended behavior due to the typo. Setting <code class=\"notranslate\">elementToCheck.style.display</code> to the invalid value <code class=\"notranslate\">\"content\"</code> is a no-op, so it just remains as whatever the previous selection was.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/display#contents\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/display#contents</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41733",
            "title": "Fix `checkVisibility` example typo `display: content` -> `contents`",
            "date_modified": "2025-10-29T10:10:31.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-10-29T10:08:44.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "lionel-rowe",
                "url": "https://github.com/lionel-rowe"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adding a few relevant characters to the math example.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There wasn't really anything that shows much of the benefit of this. This is something minimal to at least show a few characters that look better with this style.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Feedback welcome on other ideas, but I think the original isn't too helpful by itself.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> parent: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3510270262\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41506\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41506/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41506\">#41506</a></li>\n</ul>",
